# Laravel ignores /public/build because it is Vite output. This project has no
# Vite build — the stylesheet is compiled by the Tailwind standalone binary and
# committed, so a fresh clone runs with no build step. Ignore the directory but
# keep the one file that has to ship.
/public/build/*
!/public/build/app.css
/public/hot
/public/storage
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db

# Tailwind standalone CLI — a 112MB binary, downloaded not committed.
# Node 18 here cannot run Vite 7, so the standalone compiler builds our CSS.
/tools
